### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

### User Register
POST http://localhost:8181/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_name": "testuser",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "testuser@example.com"
}

### User Login
POST http://localhost:8181/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_mail": "testuser@example.com",
  "user_password": "password123"
}

### User Login fail
POST http://localhost:8181/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_mail": "testuser2@example.com",
  "user_password": "pa123"
}

### OIDC: get the IdP login URL by email domain (open "url" in a browser, sign in as testuser / testpass)
GET http://localhost:8181/api/v1/oidc/login?email=test@test.com

### OIDC: get the IdP login URL by IdP name
GET http://localhost:8181/api/v1/oidc/login?idp=keycloak
